<details><summary>Reveal the compatible-model identity</summary>
If $A(a)=\psi(a)^\top w$ and $F=\mathbb E[\psi\psi^\top]$, finite distributivity gives $\mathbb E[\psi A]=Fw$. Positive definiteness is an extra condition needed to invert $F$.
</details>

## The price of off-policy exploration

Importance sampling uses a target-to-behavior ratio. The [importance sampling](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Importance_sampling) correction is unbiased, but its second moment grows as coverage weakens.

